CHAPTER.VERS:
This was attested with an shevu'ah
oath ; for others who became kohanim were installed in the office of kehunah without a shevu'ah
oath ;

For such was for us indeed a bekavod
suitable Kohen Gadol, chasid, tamim, tahor, nivdal from chote'im
separated from sinners and exalted above HaShomayim;
